Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:33:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 35/35] wgridder: expose ducc0 phase timers behind
 MX_WGRIDDER_VERBOSE

wsclean never sets the wgridder verbosity flag, so ducc0's TimerHierarchy
table (gridding proper / FFT / wscreen / zeroing) was unreachable. Off by
default; default behaviour unchanged.

diff --git a/wgridder/wgridder_implementation.h b/wgridder/wgridder_implementation.h
index 4ed7c21c..2f79ca10 100644
--- a/wgridder/wgridder_implementation.h
+++ b/wgridder/wgridder_implementation.h
@@ -41,7 +41,7 @@ WGridder<NumT>::WGridder(size_t width, size_t height, size_t trimmed_width, size
       l_shift_(l_shift),
       m_shift_(m_shift),
       epsilon_(epsilon),
-      verbosity_(verbosity),
+      verbosity_(std::max<size_t>(verbosity, std::getenv("MX_WGRIDDER_VERBOSE") ? 1u : 0u)),
       use_metal_(use_metal) {
   MR_assert(verbosity <= 2, "verbosity must be 0, 1, or 2");
 }
